comment.narrative:
This indicator indicates the number of pilot schools that comply with at least 5 out of 10 categories of investment. Investment categories include: 
1. increasing the capacity of the existing school kitchen and its equipment;
2. increasing the capacity of the existing dining room and its equipment;
3. additional arrangement and equipment of school premises for WDS;
4. additional equipment of classrooms, cabinets and practice;
5. additional arrangement and equipment of space for the professional work of teachers in the school;
6. work on adaptation and equipment of school playgrounds/ school sports halls;
7. additional arrangement and adjustment of existing sanitary nodes;
8. additional improvement of air conditioning conditions in the school;
9. additional equipment of multipurpose space;
10.  other equipment (vehicles).

Tracked by MSEY through signed contracts with the schools and founders.
